{"productId": "b81925c8-18d8-4644-835a-dee8610dc8d7", "modelName": "Five-seveN MRD", "modelDescription": "With more than two decades of trusted service, the original FN Five-seveN breaks new ground in 2022, redefining handgun accuracy standards with optics-ready capabilities, enhanced ergonomics, and improved controls. The FN Five-seveN MRD's proprietary optics-mounting system consists of a series of plates that match your optic to the slide for a quick and seamless setup, simply remove the cover plate, select the compatible optic plate and screw set that match your MRD and mount using the provided hardware. The system is compatible with most common optic footprints, offering an unmatched variety of options. Its stippling and textures on the ergonomic frame as well as enhanced serrations on the slide, trigger guard and safety selector enable superior grip and control in an already soft-recoiling pistol. The internal hammer and smooth trigger pull, coupled with the long-lasting 4.8-inch cold hammer-forged and chrome-lined barrel, provide the ultimate package to achieve precision at a distance.", "manufacturerName": "FN America", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "996a07d8-c697-4a08-8322-de4b1535b557", "description": "FN, Five-seveN MRD, Striker Fired, 5.7x28mm Caliber, 4.80 Barrel, Overall Flat Dark Earth Finish, Picatinny Rail/Serrated Trigger Guard Frame, Serrated/Optic Cut Slide & Texture Polymer Grip Includes 2 Mags, 10 Rounds", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/d9469f72-3571-4255-980b-85bf9734c535", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/3aac8b26-f675-4e54-8f33-0a69230de472", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/20127c19-5c84-4b65-9979-ebbb477f4d14", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/8d4717c1-aaae-48aa-b959-0a03918d5a26"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "66-101277", "upc": "845737015138", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "1dbab5b3-c07e-4fd5